<title>USA: Chicago Water District repriced, top yld 5.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Chicago Water District repriced, top yld 5.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mesirow Financial Inc said Tuesday it repriced Metropolitan Water Reclamation District of Greater Chicago's $117.6 million bond deal. The top yield at the repricing was 5.30 percent in 2014.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>METROPOLITAN WATER RECLAMATION DISTRICT OF GREATER CHICAGO</p>
<p>COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS</p>
<p>RE: $117,550,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES OF JULY 1997</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aa2</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>FITCH: AA</p>
<p>DATED: 7/1/1997</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON 12/1/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/1</p>
